{"obsah":"<p>For the first time in the history of our project we tried starting the camp season in April. We cancelled the first date because of snow and debated whether to keep the 28–29 April date too. We can only thank our participants for their flexibility – after looking at the Sunday forecast, they agreed to move to the Saturday date.</p>\n\n<p>Our coaches were able to cover both the men's and the women's group and make full use of the beautiful Sunday weather. The men threw themselves into the terrain and natural features in the beautiful Struhařov forests, while the ladies focused on technique in the Tehov park before moving to the nearby trails.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks to everyone for taking part and for your willingness. Hopefully you'll notice the improvement on every ride this year. </p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F04%2FIMG_2136.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F04%2FIMG_2136.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208617\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F04%2FIMG_2134.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F04%2FIMG_2134.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208618\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F04%2FIMG_2133.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fupload